  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"对客户创建的「升级版」商品进行删除操作，注意已经关联计划的商品不允许进行删除，支持批量，一次性调用最大个数为100，服务为部分成功部分失败。需配合【获取Access token】接口获取授权access_token。\",\"id\":\"dpa.clue_product.delete\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/dpa/clue_product/delete/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1817606743728155\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get.access_token\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取Access token才能调用此接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"high\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1817606743728155\",\"title\":\"删除升级版商品\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-VngFA74W\">【使用场景】对客户创建的<strong>「升级版」</strong>商品进行删除操作，注意已经关联计划的商品不允许进行删除，支持批量，一次性调用最大个数为100，服务为部分成功部分失败。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-SN10CRSm\">【支持的删除方式】</p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t615773a-9QiTnPJ3\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-RR0U7RWP\"><col data-id=\"cd11d5e0-Vn8LlpS3\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"cd11d5e0-B07KEcF9\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"cd11d5e0-HGR7nVaf\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-rCiZPGhJ\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-duxcQ4Kg\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-G5VzSjlG\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-GtC2ywkW\">删除模式</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-34LnxMWv\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-dHLpq4tA\">支持类目</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-uS2SPzrS\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-t2quflGG\">类目id（category_id）</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-HUPMTIKD\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-AmfpNnbi\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-C3YXr1n8\">支持按照店铺ID+外部商品ID删除</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-Tv6yGGmY\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-lDcbC58P\">电商店铺商品</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-m04CRqDS\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-l6uo6LMY\">140000000</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-sRt6QyJt\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t1c8f800-AV5edNkq\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ka6tXaic\">按照product_id指定删除</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t1c8f800-NmZEfoJ1\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-H2ovRDgJ\">除电商店铺商品外的商品</p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-g8Anfm8W\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-jzbqn7Em\">截止12.9为活动、房产、招商加盟、教育培训、医疗服务、人资代招、岗位招聘</p></blockquote></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"t16089ba-7XU0APfD\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-xmxnxAY0\">250000000</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-oD5ZxJu6\">130000000</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZqyI6uwn\">240000000</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-HLtiLZZp\">40000000</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-tm1YgHmy\">50900000</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-zkZCAGtv\">110100000</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-WmaNflqL\">120000000</p></td></tr></tbo