2%2C%22isCustom%22%3Afalse%2C%22id%22%3A%22ogVYE%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">必填</span></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-H9Em3qJO\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-MvliSFEW\">number[]</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-nCB1RGSl\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-JZ2yeP58\">通过巨量商品id删除，支持批量，一次请求最多允许传入100个</p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-E0EGmG4r\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-BFJfKq94\">需有商品的权限才允许删除，否则会报错</p></blockquote></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-8WXN4LAC\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-MIQlOx2r\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-vIiIop8j\">store_id_and_outer_id</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-qJPKmybm\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-dabLA2kx\">object</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-G080RTu2\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-KJg4VpTb\">电商店铺商品（category_id为140000000时）支持按照店铺id+外部商品id删除，其他类目商品不需要传</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-ivvROcxy\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-M3nxm52H\" data-transient-attributes=